# Allowlist, not a blocklist. This directory holds private keys, and guessing the extensions
# they might arrive under is an unbounded game — the previous `*.pem` rule covered the auth
# signing key and would have missed an SSH deploy key (`id_ed25519`), a `.key`, or a `.p8`.
# Ignore everything and re-admit the two files that are meant to be read.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
